DATASET AND CONTENT NOTES
=========================

This MIT licence applies to the SOURCE CODE in this repository. The
following content has separate licensing arrangements:

1. **Bird images** in `dataset/raw/` and `dataset/processed/` are
   sourced from iNaturalist Australia and the Atlas of Living
   Australia (ALA). Each image retains its individual Creative Commons
   licence (typically CC-BY or CC-BY-NC). Refer to ALA and iNaturalist
   for per-image attribution.

2. **AUSLAN sign descriptions and motion illustrations** in
   `gui/static/auslan_videos/*.svg` and `docs/auslan_consultation/`
   are the author's provisional work and are NOT validated AUSLAN
   signs. They must not be reproduced or redistributed as authentic
   AUSLAN until validated through the participatory protocol described
   in `docs/auslan_consultation/validation_protocol.md`.

3. **Trained model weights** (`models/best_model.pth`) are released
   under the same MIT licence as the source code. Note that the model
   was trained on Creative-Commons-licensed images (item 1 above) and
   the resulting weights inherit no additional restrictions.
